cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the code in this repository, please cite it with the metadata
  below.
type: software
title: MovementGNN-COO
abstract: >-
  Code of MovementGNN: a physics-informed graph attention network for military
  terrain traversability classification. It holds the data download, the
  doctrinal label rules, the terrain graph construction and spatial split, the
  GATv2 model with its COO-informed physics loss, training, the random forest,
  MLP and rule-based baselines, full-graph inference, the post-training
  analyses and the figure scripts. No data are included.
